<view class="workspace"><view class="workspace-head"><text class="head-title">{{student.studentName}}</text><text class="head-sub">{{student.studentId}} · {{student.className}} · {{student.major}}</text></view><view class="section"><view class="panel"><view class="head-row"><text class="card-title">当前摘要</text><text class="{{student.riskLevel === '较高风险' ? 'risk-high' : 'risk-watch'}}">{{student.riskLevel}}</text></view><view class="card-meta"><text>测评状态：{{student.completion}}</text><text wx:if="{{student.latestScore}}">状态指数：{{student.latestScore}}</text></view></view><view class="panel" wx:if="{{risk}}"><text class="card-title">风险提示</text><text class="card-sub">{{risk.summary}}</text><view class="card-meta"><text>{{risk.source}}</text><text>{{risk.createdAt}}</text><text>{{risk.status}}</text></view><view class="primary-btn" style="margin:24rpx 0 0;" bindtap="followup">确认并记录跟进</view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">测评历史摘要</text></view><view class="list-card" wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id"><view class="card-main"><text class="card-title">{{item.assessmentName}}</text><view class="card-meta"><text>{{item.date}}</text><text>{{item.level}}</text><text>标准分 {{item.stdScore}}</text></view></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{results.length === 0}}">暂无可查看的测评摘要</view></view><view class="notice">原始答案默认不展示。查看更高敏感级别数据必须具备额外权限并写入审计日志。</view></view>
